RSF-DETR
========

This project implements the Routing--Structure--Frequency Enhanced Detection
Transformer (RSF-DETR) described in the accompanying paper, including:

  - CERB  (Conditional Expert Routing Block)
  - MESA  (Multi-Scale Edge Enhancement Aggregation)
  - SFFN  (Spectral-Enhanced Feed-Forward Network)

Base framework and license
--------------------------
This repository is derived from Ultralytics RT-DETR / YOLO
(https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics), version family aligned with
RT-DETR v8.0.201 as stated in the paper. Because the complete fork is
redistributed here, the repository-level LICENSE is GNU AGPL-3.0. A separate
commercial license may be required for uses that do not comply with AGPL-3.0.

